menu "RetroBridge Chile"

    choice RB_BOARD
        prompt "Board profile"
        default RB_BOARD_UNCONFIRMED
        help
            Hardware profile of the ESP32 board (H3-11). Only an unconfirmed
            profile exists until the real board is identified and its pinout,
            power and level shifting are verified (Annex A, H3c/H4). With it the
            firmware initialises no microSD bus, no board GPIO and no SIO signal.

        config RB_BOARD_UNCONFIRMED
            bool "Unconfirmed (hardware not validated: storage and SIO disabled)"
    endchoice

endmenu
